# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:702 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_80a46cdc_1:
msgid "[_M_] Yeah.... during my workout this morning, I was thinking about how grateful I am that I didn't have to go to the strip club last night, and for quite a few Saturdays now."
