# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:814 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_1269d6c5:
msgid "[_R_] Of course.... I mean \"little [ryan]\" won't be visiting.... I mean.... yuck!.... Why would I react like that to my own mom?"
